Hide
Type "./bin/sltty -demo"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Show

# Pictures, avatars and custom emoji; v opens a message's pictures.
Ctrl+K
Type "help"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Type "k"
Sleep 600ms
Type "v"
Sleep 1.5s
Type "l"
Sleep 900ms
Type "l"
Sleep 900ms
Escape
Sleep 600ms
Type "I"
Sleep 1.2s
Type "I"
Sleep 1s
